<speak>I take a few, mostly of little details. A shop sign, an interesting doorway, a bowl of something we enjoyed eating. My husband takes the broad views. Afterwards our photographs look as though we were on different holidays, which makes us laugh. I do not post much online. I might send a picture to the family chat, but I prefer not to spend the afternoon choosing a caption. My aunt would probably reply with a photograph of her orchids anyway.</speak>